# The functions of Mission_MosquitoClue in level scrapyard (the script levels/scrapyard/scripts/mission_mosquitoclue.py of data02.packed) that are data: one section
# per function, its parameters after the name. The other functions of the script stay Python: GetMosquitoProfile, InitStatus, Init, InitSwarm, InitMosquito, CreateMosquito, MosquitoDeath, TakeDataPack, InitPoliChat, SetNextMission.
# Made by a converter from the script. A pack in mods/ with scrapc/levels/scrapyard/mission_mosquitoclue.def replaces this file.
section UsePhoneCab UsrName CharName optId FullOption
setvar Speech.PlayerName $UsrName
setvar Speech.NPCName $CharName
call PhoneCab.UseAudioCom $UsrName $CharName $optId $FullOption
setvar Speech.OnEndOfSpeech %Mission_MosquitoClue.SetNextMission
setvar Speech.OnEndOfSpeechParams ()
call Speech.NISpeech "PoliceBoss"
call Speech.AutoAddNI "Mission_Get2ndClue_ComPoliceBoss_NI_1Msg"
call Speech.RunNI
